# Coverage Ignore Patterns
# This file specifies packages and files that should be excluded from code coverage reports.
# Each line represents a grep pattern to exclude from coverage analysis.

# Examples - Auto-generated mocks should not be counted in coverage
/internal/mocks

# Examples - Example applications are not part of the library's testable code
/examples

# Telemetry - OpenTelemetry initialization code requires complex external dependencies
# and infrastructure setup (OTLP endpoints, trace collectors, etc.) that are not
# suitable for unit testing. This code is tested through:
# - Integration tests in real environments
# - Manual testing with actual telemetry backends
# - Production monitoring
# Reason: Mocking OpenTelemetry components would result in tests that don't reflect
# real behavior and add maintenance overhead without meaningful coverage value.
/internal/telemetry

# Note: Individual functions cannot be excluded using grep patterns.
# The patterns above work at the package level only.
# For documenting untested functions, see COVERAGE_EXCEPTIONS.md
